  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Non-Comedogenic</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Reef Safe SPF</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Light Coverage</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Good for: Acne/Blemishes</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Vegan</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Fragrance Free</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Natural Finish</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><p><strong>What it is: </strong>A two-in-one natural finish SPF 30 skin tint with 100 percent mineral broad-spectrum protection, light-medium buildable coverage, and no pore-clogging ingredients - ideal for problem-prone or sensitive skin. </p><p><br></p><p><strong>Coverage: </strong>Light</p><p><strong><br>Finish: </strong>Natural</p><p><strong><br>Formulation: </strong>Liquid</p><p><br></p><p><strong>SPF: </strong>SPF 30<strong><br><br>Highlighted Ingredients: <br></strong>- Non-Nano Zinc Oxide: Protects from UVA/UVB damage and is suitable for sensitive skin.</p><p>- Pricky Pear Extract: Protects from blue light pollution.</p><p>- White Sage Extract: Is soothing and neutralizes free radicals from the sun.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Ingredie</strong></p></div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><b>Suggested Usage:<br></b>Light/sheer coverage (to even out redness, discoloration):<br>-Apply with your fingertips like moisturizer and blend out.<br><br>Medium/buildable coverage (to cover blemishes, discoloration):<br>-Tap on with a dampened beauty sponge or foundation or stippling brush. Tap to layer for higher coverage.<br><br><b>Recycling Instructions:<br>-</b>Unbox SunnyDays, flatten the unit carton, and recycle! SunnyDays&rsquo; Earth Sensitive tube is made from 60 percent post-consumer recycled resin.</div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\">-Non-Nano Zinc Oxide: A sunscreen that protects from UVA/UVB damage and suitable for sensitive skin.<br>-Prickly Pear Extract: Reparative and helps protects from blue-light pollution.<br>-White Sage Extract: Reduces the appearance of irritation and helps neutralize free radicals from the sun.<br><br>Zinc oxide, 12.6%, Water/Aqua/Eau, Isononyl Isononanoate, C9-12 Alkane, Butyloctyl Salicylate, Polyglyceryl-6 Polyricinoleate, Caprylic/Capric Triglyceride, Glycerin, Ethylhexyl Methoxycrylene, Trimethylsiloxysilicate, Mica, Polyglyceryl-2 Isostearate, Sodium Chloride, Phenoxyethanol, Disteardimonium Hectorite, Polyglyceryl-3 Polyricinoleate, Polyhydroxystearic Acid, Coco-Caprylate/Caprate, Isostearic Acid, Lecithin, Polyglyceryl-6 Polyhydroxystearate, Jojoba Esters, Ethylhexylglycerin, Sodium Phytate, Aloe Barbadensis Leaf Water, Centella Asiatica Extract, Opuntia Tuna Fruit, Salvia Officinalis (Sage) Extract, May Contain (+/-): Iron Oxides (CI 77491, CI 77492, CI 77499), Titanium Dioxide (CI 77891).<br><br><i>The list of ingredients is subject to change, please consult the packaging of the product purchased.</i></div></details>",
  "description_html": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Non-Comedogenic</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Reef Safe SPF</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Light Coverage</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Good for: Acne/Blemishes</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Vegan</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Fragrance Free</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Natural Finish</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><p><strong>What it is: </strong>A two-in-one natural finish SPF 30 skin tint with 100 percent mineral broad-spectrum protection, light-medium buildable coverage, and no pore-clogging ingredients - ideal for problem-prone or sensitive skin. </p><p><br></p><p><strong>Coverage: </strong>Light</p><p><strong><br>Finish: </strong>Natural</p><p><strong><br>Formulation: </strong>Liquid</p><p><br></p><p><strong>SPF: </strong>SPF 30<strong><br><br>Highlighted Ingredients: <br></strong>- Non-Nano Zinc Oxide: Protects from UVA/UVB damage and is suitable for sensitive skin.</p><p>- Pricky Pear Extract: Protects from blue light pollution.</p><p>- White Sage Extract: Is soothing and neutralizes free radicals from the sun.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Ingredie</strong></p></div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><b>Suggested Usage:<br></b>Light/sheer coverage (to even out redness, discoloration):<br>-Apply with your fingertips like moisturizer and blend out.<br><br>Medium/buildable coverage (to cover blemishes, discoloration):<br>-Tap on with a dampened beauty sponge or foundation or stippling brush. Tap to layer for higher coverage.<br><br><b>Recycling Instructions:<br>-</b>Unbox SunnyDays, flatten the unit carton, and recycle! SunnyDays&rsquo; Earth Sensitive tube is made from 60 percent post-consumer recycled resin.</div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\">-Non-Nano Zinc Oxide: A sunscreen that protects from UVA/UVB damage and suitable for sensitive skin.<br>-Prickly Pear Extract: Reparative and helps protects from blue-light pollution.<br>-White Sage Extract: Reduces the appearance of irritation and helps neutralize free radicals from the sun.<br><br>Zinc oxide, 12.6%, Water/Aqua/Eau, Isononyl Isononanoate, C9-12 Alkane, Butyloctyl Salicylate, Polyglyceryl-6 Polyricinoleate, Caprylic/Capric Triglyceride, Glycerin, Ethylhexyl Methoxycrylene, Trimethylsiloxysilicate, Mica, Polyglyceryl-2 Isostearate, Sodium Chloride, Phenoxyethanol, Disteardimonium Hectorite, Polyglyceryl-3 Polyricinoleate, Polyhydroxystearic Acid, Coco-Caprylate/Caprate, Isostearic Acid, Lecithin, Polyglyceryl-6 Polyhydroxystearate, Jojoba Esters, Ethylhexylglycerin, Sodium Phytate, Aloe Barbadensis Leaf Water, Centella Asiatica Extract, Opuntia Tuna Fruit, Salvia Officinalis (Sage) Extract, May Contain (+/-): Iron Oxides (CI 77491, CI 77492, CI 77499), Titanium Dioxide (CI 77891).<br><br><i>The list of ingredients is subject to change, please consult the packaging of the product purchased.</i></div></details>",
